Comment: 0,0:00:45.58,0:00:47.82,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HF5F4F5&\3c&H9A3AD9&}喵  喵  喵  喵  喵
Comment: 0,0:00:48.64,0:00:49.45,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HF5F4F5&\3c&H9A3AD9&}喵
Comment: 0,0:00:53.79,0:00:55.23,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H3B2CD5&}太不可思议了...
Comment: 0,0:00:56.55,0:00:58.38,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H088209&}太超模了
Comment: 0,0:00:59.65,0:01:01.30,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H088209&}令人无法抗拒
Comment: 0,0:01:04.19,0:01:07.19,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFF2700&}在狭窄的道路上  我们巧合地相遇了
Comment: 0,0:01:07.26,0:01:10.21,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFF2700&}立马就被你那黑洞一样的深邃眼神所吸引
Comment: 0,0:01:10.60,0:01:12.26,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HE618EA&}你的冷漠、温柔和夸张
Comment: 0,0:01:12.26,0:01:14.28,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HE618EA&}为何会让我心跳不已呢？？
Comment: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:19.88,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H18179B&}下午可能会下雨
Comment: 0,0:01:20.06,0:01:23.14,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H18179B&}不如提前去吃午饭吧
Comment: 0,0:01:23.22,0:01:26.38,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HAB4ED9&}在阳光下尽情享受着日光浴
Comment: 0,0:01:26.38,0:01:29.38,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HAB4ED9&}这小可爱到底是何方神圣
Comment: 0,0:01:30.20,0:01:33.42,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HA99400&}从今往后  我都是属于你的了
Comment: 0,0:01:33.42,0:01:36.50,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HA99400&}过度的深爱  让时空也扭曲了
Comment: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:40.40,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}不知不觉间  你已经成为了我的宇宙
Comment: 0,0:01:40.42,0:01:41.39,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}怦怦直跳心情
Comment: 0,0:01:41.39,0:01:42.80,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}让我倍感煎熬...
Comment: 0,0:01:42.80,0:01:45.97,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFA0F7E&}说是命运也好  奇迹也罢
Comment: 0,0:01:45.97,0:01:49.04,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFA0F7E&}我们的相遇就是宇宙大爆炸
Comment: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:52.97,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H5D03FF&}夜空中悬挂的星星就是奇迹
Comment: 0,0:01:52.97,0:01:56.05,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H5D03FF&}纯然的爱不需要自我
Comment: 0,0:01:56.92,0:01:59.97,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H19A20C&}我只想一直陪在你的身边...
